        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717",
          "sha": "ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717"
        }
      ],
      "message": "wallet: reject recipient amounts above MAX_MONEY\n\nCreateTransaction only checks that recipient amounts are not negative.\nCreateTransactionInternal then adds them up in recipients_sum, which can\noverflow int64. For example, fundrawtransaction on a raw tx with two\noutputs of 2^62 sat, or sendmany/walletcreatefundedpsbt with enough\nMAX_MONEY outputs. The negative sum then reaches coin selection and the\nnode aborts on assert(!m_selected_inputs.empty()) in RecalculateWaste.\nWith other values the sum wraps to a small positive number and funding\nsucceeds with outputs far above MAX_MONEY.\n\nCheck that every amount and the running sum stay within MoneyRange\nbefore starting coin selection.",
